<title>CROATIA: Croatian M1, M4 money supply rise in May vs April.</title>
<headline>Croatian M1, M4 money supply rise in May vs April.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MONEY SUPPLY	     MAY	 APRIL	MAY 96</p>
<p> Reserve money (million HRK)  8,742.8    8,591.9    6,811.5</p>
<p> M1 money supply		 11,472.3   11,405.9    8,999.7</p>
<p> Broadest money M4	     41,207.9   40,596.4   28,236.9</p>
<p>-- Zagreb newsroom +385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
